    {
      "source": "The argument may be a single variable value or a <code>Map</code> with multiple\nvariables and values. Each value may be a String or an Object to be converted\nto a String through the configured <a href=\"../../../core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a>.",
      "translation": "参数可以是单个变量值，或包含多个变量和值的 `<code>Map</code>`。每个值可以是 String，或通过配置的 <a href=\"../../../core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> 转换为 String 的 Object。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return information about the request value, or <code>null</code> if the\nparameter does not represent a request value of interest.",
      "translation": "返回有关请求值的信息，或者如果该参数不代表感兴趣的请求值，则返回<code>null</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../../bind/annotation/PathVariable.html#required()\"><code>PathVariable.required()</code></a> is set to <code>false</code>",
      "translation": "<a href=\"../../bind/annotation/PathVariable.html#required()\"><code>PathVariable.required()</code></a> 设置为<code>false</code>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If the value is required but <code>null</code>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalArgumentException</code></a>\nis raised. The value is not required if:",
      "translation": "如果该值必需但为 `<code>null</code>`，则抛出 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalArgumentException</code></a>。在以下情况下该值不是必需的：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If the resolver was created with a <a href=\"../../../core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a>, the value\nwill have been converted to a String and may be cast down.",
      "translation": "如果解析器是使用带有<a href=\"../../../core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a>创建的，则该值将已转换为字符串，并且可以向下转换。",
      "count": 1
    },
